---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { projects } from '../lib/data';
---
<Base title="Start contributing" description="Find a project, open a pull request, and earn verifiable open-source recognition with AppKade Open.">
  <div class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">02 / CONTRIBUTE</p><h1>Great things begin <span class="gradient-text">with a PR.</span></h1><p class="lede">No AppKade account, application form or approval queue. Collaboration happens where the code lives: GitHub.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/projects/">Explore projects ↗</a><a class="button ghost" href="/docs/contributing/">Read the guidelines →</a></div></div>
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="steps-title"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE PROCESS</p><h2 id="steps-title">Three steps. <span class="quiet-heading">Real impact.</span></h2></div></div><div class="grid steps">
    <article class="card process-card"><div class="step-top"><span class="step-number">01</span><span class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌕</span></div><h3>Choose a project</h3><p>Explore our maintained projects. Look for issues that match your skills or curiosity.</p><a href="/projects/">Browse projects ↗</a></article>
    <article class="card process-card"><div class="step-top"><span class="step-number">02</span><span class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true">⑂</span></div><h3>Open a pull request</h3><p>Follow the repo guidelines, make one focused change, and collaborate through code review.</p><a href="https://github.com/AppKade">Visit our repositories ↗</a></article>
    <article class="card process-card"><div class="step-top"><span class="step-number">03</span><span class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true">✧</span></div><h3>Get recognized</h3><p>After an eligible PR is merged, your public GitHub-linked contribution appears in the next sync.</p><a href="/docs/contributing/">Scoring rules ↗</a></article>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="starting-projects"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">START HERE</p><h2 id="starting-projects">Pick a place to <span class="quiet-heading">begin.</span></h2></div><a href="/projects/" class="text-link">All projects ↗</a></div><div class="stack">{projects.length ? projects.map(project =>
    <article class="card"><p class="tagline">{project.category} · {project.status}</p><h3><a href={`/projects/${project.slug}/`}>{project.name}</a></h3><p>{project.description}</p><a class="text-link" href={`https://github.com/${project.repo}/issues`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore open issues ↗</a></article>
  ) : <div class="empty"><h3>Projects are on their way.</h3><p>Check the GitHub organization for newly published projects.</p><a href="https://github.com/AppKade">Explore AppKade on GitHub ↗</a></div>}</div></section>
  <section class="final-cta"><div><p class="eyebrow">KEEP IT USEFUL</p><h2>Quality over <span class="gradient-text">quantity.</span></h2><p>Spam and artificially split contributions don't earn recognition. Every point links to a real reviewed and merged PR.</p></div><a class="button" href="https://github.com/AppKade/open/issues">Ask a question ↗</a></section>
</Base>
